shortdesc Bottom placement option for double float in two column mode (nidan-kumi)
relocated 1
longdesc This package enables a bottom placement option for double
longdesc floats in two column mode (nidan-kumi). It was originally part
longdesc of the Japanese pLaTeX bundle and is now distributed as a
longdesc separate package because it supports all LaTeX formats.
